     ] )
  ] ) ; # 
  fhir:description [ fhir:v "A demonstration IG that declares, as TestPlan resources and Gherkin feature files, the conformance tests for the six actors of the EU Health Data API IG (EHDS Annex II): Document Publisher, Document Access Provider (with the Document Submission Option), Document Consumer, grouped Document Publisher/Access Provider, Resource Access Provider and Resource Consumer. The IG states its requirements as capabilitystatement-expectation extensions rather than profile obligations, so every test case is traceable to the CapabilityStatement expectation it tests."] ; # 
